    LineComment "// The collection primitives fold at compile time: list.len and map.len count"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// entries, the native fold threads an accumulator over the entries (a list's key"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// is the element index, a map's the entry key), and the foldable provided"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// methods — count, any, all, map, filter, keys, values — fold through it. The"
